  "title": "Customize the Options Screen Display [RPG Maker MZ Plugin]",
  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "title",
      "type": "title",
      "source": "オプション画面の表示をカスタマイズ【RPGツクールMZプラグイン】",
      "sourceHash": "c085caa3f999235aa7dc0a3739efed96361bfaffd8a29f32e3b35bb6493bcd36",
      "translation": "Customize the Options Screen Display [RPG Maker MZ Plugin]",
      "contextHash": "c085caa3f999235aa7dc0a3739efed96361bfaffd8a29f32e3b35bb6493bcd36"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-001",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "オプション画面の表示をカスタマイズします。",
      "sourceHash": "318e1105b0b71efee654c4aab06b5e0b575f760a9cc0ca74f06e52566bd14704",
      "translation": "Customize the display of the Options screen.",
      "contextHash": "318e1105b0b71efee654c4aab06b5e0b575f760a9cc0ca74f06e52566bd14704"
    },
    {
      "id": "heading-001",
      "type": "heading",
      "source": "主な機能",
      "sourceHash": "c38e630d348b526e176f6cfd8a4c185e06c0a28dde73c13226a6074d2f726c42",
      "translation": "Main Features",
      "contextHash": "c38e630d348b526e176f6cfd8a4c185e06c0a28dde73c13226a6074d2f726c42"
    },
    {
      "id": "list-001",
      "type": "list",
      "source": "区切りを挿入",
      "sourceHash": "6cef0e461bf6dd2ad4b353e02e253da82b33b61b83e0b51f465d73d5576a1de5",
      "translation": "Insert separators",
      "contextHash": "6cef0e461bf6dd2ad4b353e02e253da82b33b61b83e0b51f465d73d5576a1de5"
    },
    {
      "id": "list-002",
      "type": "list",
      "source": "ウィンドウのサイズを変更",
      "sourceHash": "aae1f0e9b5a6cb84ded10e36c61056da4ae53c162807489da93c96f942b30426",
      "translation": "Change the window size",
      "contextHash": "aae1f0e9b5a6cb84ded10e36c61056da4ae53c162807489da93c96f942b30426"
    },
    {
      "id": "list-003",
      "type": "list",
      "source": "表示項目数を変更",
      "sourceHash": "0767103a5e3c60b969f90d63013c55db67811aada9bfeee21ffed788dd33a335",
      "translation": "Change the number of visible items",
      "contextHash": "0767103a5e3c60b969f90d63013c55db67811aada9bfeee21ffed788dd33a335"
    },
    {
      "id": "list-004",
      "type": "list",
      "source": "音量の増減量（標準は20）を変更",
      "sourceHash": "4f0e45ba790046b37eb7b8b3b4ff01ad9cb1da80ca8d92e3e2d68a6d45d1afd5",
      "translation": "Change the volume increment/decrement amount (default: 20)",
      "contextHash": "4f0e45ba790046b37eb7b8b3b4ff01ad9cb1da80ca8d92e3e2d68a6d45d1afd5"
    },
    {
      "id": "heading-002",
      "type": "heading",
      "source": "目次",
      "sourceHash": "6763aa62211b44a20c71505eed18421683192c2f2f37668012e8aaa008367120",
      "translation": "Table of Contents",
      "contextHash": "6763aa62211b44a20c71505eed18421683192c2f2f37668012e8aaa008367120"
    },
    {
      "id": "heading-003",
      "type": "heading",
      "source": "導入方法（install）",
      "sourceHash": "a74eebb051e898173751a501ebea136f6891e7f24c5dc00722bd5bd693d13275",
      "translation": "Installation (install)",
      "contextHash": "a74eebb051e898173751a501ebea136f6891e7f24c5dc00722bd5bd693d13275"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-002",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "以下のリンクを右クリックで保存し 、[プロジェクト]\\js\\plugins に放り込みます。ツクールのプラグイン管理から機能をONにしてください。",
      "sourceHash": "df37526b20b5f2ba92e3b1a5531ab0d95afff6043931b4bc2347f126750d5d3d",
      "translation": "Right-click the link below to save it, then place it in [Project]\\js\\plugins. Turn the feature ON from the Plugin Manager in RPG Maker.",
      "contextHash": "df37526b20b5f2ba92e3b1a5531ab0d95afff6043931b4bc2347f126750d5d3d"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-003",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "※このプラグインはＭＺ専用です。",
      "sourceHash": "ed0c5667915fe7ad6e95a93a20e8331a11f4cc8b43f40dd22f930598cecbf19d",
      "translation": "※This plugin is for MZ only.",
      "contextHash": "ed0c5667915fe7ad6e95a93a20e8331a11f4cc8b43f40dd22f930598cecbf19d"
    },
    {
      "id": "link-001",
      "type": "link",
      "source": "NRP_OptionCustomize.js",
      "sourceHash": "70eb5872e0b0fe6355e26fd0d3cde8f0cb3b75aca1ce3582559ae131097fac03",
      "translation": "NRP_OptionCustomize.js",
      "contextHash": "d8ca907edd254c1755ccb2954cea8f6f0a308729a9a7b7c82b33db22a2beae93"
    },
    {
      "id": "heading-004",
      "type": "heading",
      "source": "更新履歴（History）",
      "sourceHash": "5f6734086058838026416575c635cfc7e1074ad8b8757438df171ba1ac7963c7",
      "translation": "Update History (History)",
      "contextHash": "5f6734086058838026416575c635cfc7e1074ad8b8757438df171ba1ac7963c7"
    },
    {
      "id": "list-005",
      "type": "list",
      "source": "公開！",
      "sourceHash": "db16b64ccc528b64a0ff8adf39553bdd72ca60eb32c274c6a2d0185b3be59664",
      "translation": "Released!",
      "contextHash": "db16b64ccc528b64a0ff8adf39553bdd72ca60eb32c274c6a2d0185b3be59664"
    },
    {
      "id": "list-006",
      "type": "list",
      "source": "音量の増減量に小数を許可。（2024/08/02 ver1.001）",
      "sourceHash": "e30f1a1910513970a22ff27834846da7ff682463aa5102bcf87c0a02d3822065",
      "translation": "Decimal values are now allowed for the volume increment/decrement amount. (2024/08/02 ver1.001)",
      "contextHash": "e30f1a1910513970a22ff27834846da7ff682463aa5102bcf87c0a02d3822065"
    },
    {
      "id": "heading-005",
      "type": "heading",
      "source": "注意点（Notice）",
      "sourceHash": "fa3299f1e938208d8e5b6d58c9b496bc8f9347c77a554d10a359ea869f0706a0",
      "translation": "Notes (Notice)",
      "contextHash": "fa3299f1e938208d8e5b6d58c9b496bc8f9347c77a554d10a359ea869f0706a0"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-004",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "区切りも内部的には項目としてカウントされます。",
      "sourceHash": "ddda1545762bb326b1258c393db3d19c12ea78d94034a754209934e9ec2b286f",
      "translation": "Separators are also counted as items internally.",
      "contextHash": "ddda1545762bb326b1258c393db3d19c12ea78d94034a754209934e9ec2b286f"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-005",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "複数の区切りを挿入した場合は、他の区切りも挿入位置に影響するのでご注意ください。",
      "sourceHash": "21847d9145016426df582ffd5ed01021db588f5a6ce64665b26dad9684e14953",
      "translation": "Please note that inserting multiple separators will also affect the insertion positions of other separators.",
      "contextHash": "21847d9145016426df582ffd5ed01021db588f5a6ce64665b26dad9684e14953"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-006",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "プラグイン一覧では、オプションに項目を追加するプラグインよりも、下に配置したほうが競合の影響を抑えられると思います。",
      "sourceHash": "bcb376df6b27bd70d56037ff06b74e78f0ee78af0693f5552949f7112346bb37",
      "translation": "In the Plugin Manager, placing this plugin below plugins that add items to the Options screen should help reduce the impact of conflicts.",
      "contextHash": "bcb376df6b27bd70d56037ff06b74e78f0ee78af0693f5552949f7112346bb37"
    },
    {
      "id": "heading-006",
      "type": "heading",
      "source": "プラグインパラメータ（Plugin Parameters）",
      "sourceHash": "7876cc6e169aa1ffb59ad7ff0263d5dbdd1b309638a0319bcebc599acddc70ad",
      "translation": "Plugin Parameters (Plugin Parameters)",
      "contextHash": "7876cc6e169aa1ffb59ad7ff0263d5dbdd1b309638a0319bcebc599acddc70ad"
    },
    {
      "id": "heading-007",
      "type": "heading",
      "source": "区切りリスト（SeparateList）",
      "sourceHash": "7325555ccf7475fde2d738690cb55bd1c3dbaddcb92681ad40699769cc439cd6",
      "translation": "Separator List (SeparateList)",
      "contextHash": "7325555ccf7475fde2d738690cb55bd1c3dbaddcb92681ad40699769cc439cd6"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-007",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "区切りを定義します。",
      "sourceHash": "2545ac02ad16ae5fb0c1f755d428f2b258da04fc42f580d6ab4c32631d407b53",
      "translation": "Defines the separators.",
      "contextHash": "2545ac02ad16ae5fb0c1f755d428f2b258da04fc42f580d6ab4c32631d407b53"
    },
    {
      "id": "heading-008",
      "type": "heading",
      "source": "区切りを中央寄せ（SeparateCenter）",
      "sourceHash": "2fa3f52c7068474e9b0914926129ad28fa5e36a9d689acca6dfd4280a9a4aac6",
      "translation": "Center Separators (SeparateCenter)",
      "contextHash": "2fa3f52c7068474e9b0914926129ad28fa5e36a9d689acca6dfd4280a9a4aac6"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-008",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "区切りを中央寄せします。",
      "sourceHash": "769f989f54a8794fd7bff02b0457e83db79ee2dec4593d7f288700bf84a957d1",
      "translation": "Centers the separators.",
      "contextHash": "769f989f54a8794fd7bff02b0457e83db79ee2dec4593d7f288700bf84a957d1"
    },
    {
      "id": "heading-009",
      "type": "heading",
      "source": "表示項目数（MaxVisibleCommands）",
      "sourceHash": "83ac03e89f06c3413b45faea6c9cfb11a51daae875fb74cb40c8f3a89b330311",
      "translation": "Number of Visible Items (MaxVisibleCommands)",
      "contextHash": "83ac03e89f06c3413b45faea6c9cfb11a51daae875fb74cb40c8f3a89b330311"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-009",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "ウィンドウ内に表示するオプションのコマンド数です。",
      "sourceHash": "02c8a549a1dc0f73f08a15592a74f4731ca641831a19af7e9cf4e8e41dc30659",
      "translation": "The number of option commands displayed in the window.",
      "contextHash": "02c8a549a1dc0f73f08a15592a74f4731ca641831a19af7e9cf4e8e41dc30659"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-010",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "初期値は12です。",
      "sourceHash": "bad5c954ce4f53fb5d9531ae32761c3c8ed2e7032e6d7961240f5d03273ccb24",
      "translation": "The default value is 12.",
      "contextHash": "bad5c954ce4f53fb5d9531ae32761c3c8ed2e7032e6d7961240f5d03273ccb24"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-011",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "項目数が１２より多い場合や、項目を追加するプラグインに不備や競合がある場合はウィンドウ内に全ての項目が収まらないことがあります。そういった場合は、この値を設定してみてください。",
      "sourceHash": "9eff345b5008ad8efd880410365fdae0a00e722f8df59340fa20120e629c12bd",
      "translation": "If there are more than 12 items, or if a plugin that adds items has defects or conflicts, all items may not fit in the window. In such cases, try setting this value.",
      "contextHash": "9eff345b5008ad8efd880410365fdae0a00e722f8df59340fa20120e629c12bd"
    },
    {
      "id": "heading-010",
      "type": "heading",
      "source": "ウィンドウの横幅（WindowWidth）",
      "sourceHash": "5247d178907cda05c07a3ba649c22a3690218f154dd8fb3bc5ca250420e30be9",
      "translation": "Window Width (WindowWidth)",
      "contextHash": "5247d178907cda05c07a3ba649c22a3690218f154dd8fb3bc5ca250420e30be9"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-012",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "オプションウィンドウの横幅です。初期値は400",
      "sourceHash": "3bc3e112ad1b52dc4d76fbc28a2bfc7a60ff2a8e484b2be4a7f26907c16b0cc1",
      "translation": "The width of the Options window. The default value is 400",
      "contextHash": "3bc3e112ad1b52dc4d76fbc28a2bfc7a60ff2a8e484b2be4a7f26907c16b0cc1"
    },
    {
      "id": "heading-011",
      "type": "heading",
      "source": "値の幅（ValueWidth）",
      "sourceHash": "8cfa606e4e9207ec70e6892971cecf9eaa916290af2efe08a883a45cb6e145d0",
      "translation": "Value Width (ValueWidth)",
      "contextHash": "8cfa606e4e9207ec70e6892971cecf9eaa916290af2efe08a883a45cb6e145d0"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-013",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "オプションのステータス（ON/OFFや音量）を表示する幅です。",
      "sourceHash": "b9d3b5cd7550c51d86e3706d7837cb0ec7a3581103811dbdd0dd2fbbdca5aa2a",
      "translation": "The width used to display option statuses (ON/OFF and volume).",
      "contextHash": "b9d3b5cd7550c51d86e3706d7837cb0ec7a3581103811dbdd0dd2fbbdca5aa2a"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-014",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "空欄の場合は初期値の120が適用されます。",
      "sourceHash": "56c3687e1198824bb4e36803402847bc86d666a4609bdd11ccc6a2d03aace650",
      "translation": "If left blank, the default value of 120 is applied.",
      "contextHash": "56c3687e1198824bb4e36803402847bc86d666a4609bdd11ccc6a2d03aace650"
    },
    {
      "id": "heading-012",
      "type": "heading",
      "source": "ウィンドウ背景（WindowBackgroundType）",
      "sourceHash": "8a76c9431cd388ecc7e9b8ae38d31e26eb26380dfd95764239f5c15742d9c6da",
      "translation": "Window Background (WindowBackgroundType)",
      "contextHash": "8a76c9431cd388ecc7e9b8ae38d31e26eb26380dfd95764239f5c15742d9c6da"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-015",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "オプションウィンドウの背景です。",
      "sourceHash": "06b3e82c6a27a429b3433f3757c3a1c81e601993bf63b2b9ad49811c7c919fb1",
      "translation": "The background of the Options window.",
      "contextHash": "06b3e82c6a27a429b3433f3757c3a1c81e601993bf63b2b9ad49811c7c919fb1"
    },
    {
      "id": "heading-013",
      "type": "heading",
      "source": "音量の増減量（VolumeOffset）",
      "sourceHash": "72576362e18fb2f3446d729c42bb3736b45299317042be84da1eb7cb9db2c057",
      "translation": "Volume Increment/Decrement Amount (VolumeOffset)",
      "contextHash": "72576362e18fb2f3446d729c42bb3736b45299317042be84da1eb7cb9db2c057"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-016",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "音量項目を一度に増減させる量です。",
      "sourceHash": "8cb340d2ec66ce957b7fda132352ef285f04bfdb0a088958cf9ecffaba01aaa4",
      "translation": "The amount by which volume options are increased or decreased at a time.",
      "contextHash": "8cb340d2ec66ce957b7fda132352ef285f04bfdb0a088958cf9ecffaba01aaa4"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-017",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "デフォルト値は20です。",
      "sourceHash": "02591a2454e839121f5143a1848c5d210355f661da1fe13f21069febcef1189b",
      "translation": "The default value is 20.",
      "contextHash": "02591a2454e839121f5143a1848c5d210355f661da1fe13f21069febcef1189b"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-018",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "ツクールＭＺの音量の初期値は100%になっていますが、これは一般的なＰＣゲームと比較して、かなりの爆音なので減らすことが望ましいです。",
      "sourceHash": "b11d154fb1bc206d23f82e537e332fd2f2de2bd855f7d74d45d48a34fb7f3800",
      "translation": "The default volume in RPG Maker MZ is set to 100%, but compared to typical PC games, this is extremely loud, so reducing it is recommended.",
      "contextHash": "b11d154fb1bc206d23f82e537e332fd2f2de2bd855f7d74d45d48a34fb7f3800"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-019",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "妥当な値は20か40となりますが、こうなるとたったの数段階でしか調整できないので不便です。",
      "sourceHash": "0ead96682e79912eae1765599830a36aa345a9f1e041c58b99fd1af6bc2b033f",
      "translation": "Reasonable values are 20 or 40, but this only allows adjustment in a few steps, which is inconvenient.",
      "contextHash": "0ead96682e79912eae1765599830a36aa345a9f1e041c58b99fd1af6bc2b033f"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-020",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "そこでこの値を5や10などの値に変更しておくことをオススメします。",
      "sourceHash": "f17c4807efca3e4a674561888b127743d78cd2cd7053f45cba59f8421c57c8d8",
      "translation": "Therefore, I recommend changing this value to something like 5 or 10.",
      "contextHash": "f17c4807efca3e4a674561888b127743d78cd2cd7053f45cba59f8421c57c8d8"
    },
    {
      "id": "heading-014",
      "type": "heading",
      "source": "音量表示を倍増（MagnifiedVolume）",
      "sourceHash": "8d02ef2599d1f8e471e5ca8b474080bca9b817fcdfe221566776920e8ac29f30",
      "translation": "Magnify Volume Display (MagnifiedVolume)",
      "contextHash": "8d02ef2599d1f8e471e5ca8b474080bca9b817fcdfe221566776920e8ac29f30"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-021",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "音量の表示だけを指定倍にします。",
      "sourceHash": "1791d8050ba4b12fd69f9e5430975cc36c64f19530a99015044c9a44f050fb4f",
      "translation": "Multiplies only the displayed volume by the specified amount.",
      "contextHash": "1791d8050ba4b12fd69f9e5430975cc36c64f19530a99015044c9a44f050fb4f"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-022",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "4にすると100%が400%として表示されるようになります。",
      "sourceHash": "1cf78402cdb2f8f92b926e1b1f0888f0068d9f23c00e74e7f24a143b59548b70",
      "translation": "Setting it to 4 makes 100% display as 400%.",
      "contextHash": "1cf78402cdb2f8f92b926e1b1f0888f0068d9f23c00e74e7f24a143b59548b70"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-023",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "要するに上述したCustomizeConfigDefault.jsで音量の初期値を25%に変更した場合は、この値を4にしておくと初期値の表示が100%になるので、見た目にも分かりやすいよ――という機能です。",
      "sourceHash": "5fe4267bfc1c4e67f2ea61eab8f230ce14276e2d419f919d7cf35b6be000d37e",
      "translation": "In short, if you change the default volume to 25% in the aforementioned CustomizeConfigDefault.js, setting this value to 4 makes the default value display as 100%, making it easier to understand visually— that's what this feature does.",
      "contextHash": "5fe4267bfc1c4e67f2ea61eab8f230ce14276e2d419f919d7cf35b6be000d37e"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-024",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "音量の増減量にも掛け算が適用されるので、あちらと合わせて調整してください。",
      "sourceHash": "a3c32f6bd0e619bc337b21db1e13681e077f9d2ddc411974f0c334b708dc8c02",
      "translation": "The multiplier is also applied to the volume increment/decrement amount, so adjust it together with that setting.",
      "contextHash": "a3c32f6bd0e619bc337b21db1e13681e077f9d2ddc411974f0c334b708dc8c02"
    },
    {
      "id": "heading-015",
      "type": "heading",
      "source": "区切りリストのパラメータ（Separator Parameters）",
      "sourceHash": "6e45fd5684148c1f4799661b5bd9ba00f4a4130b2a861b7cc337b2568bb1550e",
      "translation": "Separator List Parameters (Separator Parameters)",
      "contextHash": "6e45fd5684148c1f4799661b5bd9ba00f4a4130b2a861b7cc337b2568bb1550e"
    },
    {
      "id": "heading-016",
      "type": "heading",
      "source": "区切りの文字（SeparateText）",
      "sourceHash": "2e2d0a065ef0300f862803c143b39ec56c24c9ee9098c154184249c22e663648",
      "translation": "Separator Text (SeparateText)",
      "contextHash": "2e2d0a065ef0300f862803c143b39ec56c24c9ee9098c154184249c22e663648"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-025",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "区切りとして表示する内容です。",
      "sourceHash": "520f4d469037655e5cc9df60b47b556e36be34c40f68236010be7a2e7fa7a5c1",
      "translation": "The content displayed as a separator.",
      "contextHash": "520f4d469037655e5cc9df60b47b556e36be34c40f68236010be7a2e7fa7a5c1"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-026",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "制御文字も有効なので、文字色の変更やアイコンの使用も可能です。",
      "sourceHash": "a9101f01423fed2152f4d4d0dd8f3833dbcc506cd432c4b105eb102baa3f9571",
      "translation": "Control characters are also supported, so you can change the text color and use icons.",
      "contextHash": "a9101f01423fed2152f4d4d0dd8f3833dbcc506cd432c4b105eb102baa3f9571"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-027",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "（例：\\c[1]区切り）",
      "sourceHash": "5cd3ed5867a1090992605f52b2296c8d39e19aa25a624f31f653f5d9438acb3f",
      "translation": "(Example: \\c[1]Separator)",
      "contextHash": "5cd3ed5867a1090992605f52b2296c8d39e19aa25a624f31f653f5d9438acb3f"
    },
    {
      "id": "heading-017",
      "type": "heading",
      "source": "挿入位置（Position）",
      "sourceHash": "4483661006351dcd2e75e3064ea50d8cb9d677ffb643a176c23bac7f190d9171",
      "translation": "Insertion Position (Position)",
      "contextHash": "4483661006351dcd2e75e3064ea50d8cb9d677ffb643a176c23bac7f190d9171"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-028",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "区切りを挿入する位置です。",
      "sourceHash": "73fe73dcb5d04c5cdbd8f238da5f01327ba270ff449b6702b087f4ccc2fbd7aa",
      "translation": "The position where the separator will be inserted.",
      "contextHash": "73fe73dcb5d04c5cdbd8f238da5f01327ba270ff449b6702b087f4ccc2fbd7aa"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-029",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "0を先頭として設定してください。",
      "sourceHash": "2a0d734f3e8fb6a95b750c15095bc5d5cb77ea2781450a021c1854a21b6be237",
      "translation": "Set the first position as 0.",
      "contextHash": "2a0d734f3e8fb6a95b750c15095bc5d5cb77ea2781450a021c1854a21b6be237"
    }
  ],
